<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<diagram program="umlet" version="15.1">
  <zoom_level>10</zoom_level>
  <help_text>Weekly call selects All. A verified manager selects Member, Provider, Summary, or All.
Identity means name, nine-digit number, street, city, state, ZIP. Member lines: service date, provider name, service name. Provider lines: receipt timestamp, service date, member name/number, service code, fee. Provider totals: consultations and amount owed. Summary: provider rows plus overall totals. Recipient/date file names are used.</help_text>
